#: tgoverlayform.vsynccombobox.hint
msgid ""
"ON -  Synchronize the frame rate of the game with the monitor refresh rate (60Hz) \n"
"for better stability and avoid tearing.\n"
"\n"
"ADAPTIVE - Turns V-sync off if you fail to reach your refresh rate, so tearing will occur \n"
"at that point.\n"
"\n"
"MAILBOX - mailbox renders the game without a FPS limit but only sends the images \n"
"to the monitor according to the refresh rate. It provides low latency with high power \n"
"consumption, but provides low latency and tearing free.\n"
"\n"
"OFF - Do not synchronize frame rate and refresh rate, gives better \n"
"performance but produces tearing as consequence.\n"
"\n"
"UNSET - Let the game decide"
